---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Identity Governance | Blooming Systems Inc."
  description="Identity governance services from Blooming Systems Inc. help organizations manage access requests, entitlements, lifecycle processes, certifications, separation of duties, and identity controls."
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">IDENTITY GOVERNANCE</p>
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <h1>
            Know who has access,
            <span>why, and when it should change.</span>
          </h1>
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p>
              Identity governance connects access decisions with business
              ownership, policy, lifecycle events, and compliance requirements.
              We help organizations establish governance processes that work
              across cloud, SaaS, on-premises, and legacy environments.
            </p>
            <a href="/contact/" class="button">Discuss identity governance <span>↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container split">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">GOVERNANCE AT SCALE</p>
          <h2>Access should be deliberate, visible, and governed.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            As application estates grow, access becomes increasingly difficult
            to understand and manage through manual processes alone.
          </p>
          <p>
            Identity governance provides the policies, workflows, ownership,
            and evidence required to manage access throughout the identity
            lifecycle.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="dark-section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">GOVERNANCE CAPABILITIES</p>
        <h2>Bring access decisions into <span>a consistent governance model.</span></h2>

        <div class="grid">
          <article><strong>01</strong><h3>Access Requests</h3><p>Establish structured workflows for requesting and approving access to applications and entitlements.</p></article>
          <article><strong>02</strong><h3>Entitlement Management</h3><p>Organize and govern access across applications, groups, roles, and enterprise systems.</p></article>
          <article><strong>03</strong><h3>Access Certifications</h3><p>Support periodic reviews by managers, resource owners, and other responsible parties.</p></article>
          <article><strong>04</strong><h3>Lifecycle Governance</h3><p>Connect joiner, mover, and leaver events with downstream access changes.</p></article>
          <article><strong>05</strong><h3>Separation of Duties</h3><p>Identify and manage conflicting access combinations within defined governance policies.</p></article>
          <article><strong>06</strong><h3>Audit & Reporting</h3><p>Establish traceable governance records and reporting for internal and external review.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">GOVERNANCE LIFECYCLE</p>
        <h2>From access request to <span>continuous review.</span></h2>

        <div class="steps">
          <article><span>01</span><h3>Request</h3><p>A user or authorized party requests access to a resource.</p></article>
          <article><span>02</span><h3>Evaluate</h3><p>Policies, roles, ownership, and risk are evaluated.</p></article>
          <article><span>03</span><h3>Approve</h3><p>Appropriate owners review and approve access where required.</p></article>
          <article><span>04</span><h3>Provision</h3><p>Approved access is provisioned through connected systems.</p></article>
          <article><span>05</span><h3>Review</h3><p>Access is periodically reviewed and remediated as necessary.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">MAKE ACCESS GOVERNABLE</p>
        <h2>Build a clearer model for <span>enterprise access.</span></h2>
        <a href="/contact/" class="button">Start a conversation <span>↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page{color:var(--color-text)}.container{width:min(var(--container),calc(100% - (var(--gutter)*2)));margin:auto}.eyebrow{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 24px;color:var(--color-blue);font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--color-blue)}.hero{padding:180px 0 130px;background:#eef4ff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:100px;align-items:end}.hero h1{margin:0;color:var(--color-ink);font-size:clamp(52px,6vw,88px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.055em;font-weight:650}.hero h1 span,h2 span{display:block;color:var(--color-blue)}.hero-copy{max-width:520px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75}.button{display:inline-flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;min-height:52px;margin-top:28px;padding:0 24px;background:var(--color-blue);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:var(--text-sm);font-weight:650}.section{padding:120px 0}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:100px}.split h2,h2{margin:0;color:var(--color-ink);font-size:clamp(38px,4vw,62px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:650}.prose{max-width:700px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.8}.dark-section{padding:120px 0;background:var(--color-ink)}.dark-section h2{color:white;max-width:900px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;margin-top:65px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.15)}.grid article{padding:38px;min-height:250px;background:var(--color-ink)}.grid strong,.steps span{color:var(--color-blue);font-size:40px}.grid h3{margin:40px 0 15px;color:white;font-size:22px}.grid p{margin:0;color:rgba(255,255,255,.68);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:60px}.steps article{padding:30px;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border)}.steps h3{margin:42px 0 14px;color:var(--color-ink)}.steps p{margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.cta{padding:120px 0;background:#eef4ff;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}.cta h2{max-width:900px}@media(max-width:1000px){.hero-grid,.split{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.steps{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:640px){.hero{padding:130px 0 90px}.section,.dark-section,.cta{padding:85px 0}.grid,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(46px,13vw,65px)}}
</style>